  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一款由 Serilum 製作的模組。充滿愛意打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">「移動礦車」是一款可輕鬆拾取與移動礦車的模組，且無需將其破壞。</span><br><br></p>\n<p>您也可能對 <span style=\"color:#f90\"><strong><a style=\"color:#f90\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/move-boats\" rel=\"nofollow\">移動船隻</a></strong></span> 感興趣。<br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>拾取方式：</strong> 蹲下並對著礦車按右鍵。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>放置方式：</strong> 站起來後再按下蹲鍵一次。 </span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"相依模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum&#x27;s QoL Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此處示範了拾取礦車的過程；使用 TNT 礦車時請小心！</span></strong><br></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/move-minecarts/a.webp\" alt=\"預覽\" width=\"666\" height=\"474\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由將此模組用於任何模組包中，前提是下載必須繼續託管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模組的概覽及更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">評論功能已關閉，因為我無法在眾多獨立的模組頁面中追蹤評論。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請至 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 倉庫</a> 反映。感謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
